{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"vary header for image variants vary header for image variants","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md","fileName":"Vary Header for Image Variants.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Vary Header for Image Variants","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-28 04:01\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching","CDN Variant Cache Fragmentation","highperformanceimages.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"vary header for image variants vary header for image variants","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md","fileName":"Vary Header for Image Variants.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Vary Header for Image Variants","heading":"Vary Header for Image Variants","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"When one image URL can return different bytes according to a request header, the response needs to state that variation so caches do not reuse one representation for incompatible clients. The HTTP `Vary` header identifies the request fields involved.\n\nCorrectness and efficiency pull in opposite directions: omitting a real dimension risks a wrong response, while varying on too many high-cardinality fields fragments the cache. Selection inputs should therefore be normalized into a manageable policy. See [[CDN Variant Cache Fragmentation]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching","CDN Variant Cache Fragmentation","highperformanceimages.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"vary header for image variants vary header for image variants","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Vary Header for Image Variants.md","fileName":"Vary Header for Image Variants.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Vary Header for Image Variants","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[highperformanceimages.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Adaptive Image Delivery and Caching","CDN Variant Cache Fragmentation","highperformanceimages.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}